    "title": "Michael Bauer",
    "text": "Michael Bauer, beloved son of Ned and Lois Bauer and brother of Carol Davidson, Betsy Streisand, Robert Bauer and John Bauer, died Aug. 4 in Jamestown.\nHe was 62.\nMichael was a man of many talents and interests. He was dedicated to studying the cosmos, geology, Indian artifacts and space travel. He was an avid reader of science.\nIn his heart, he was a good and loving person. He will be sorely missed. His family truly loved him … and he loved them. He is finally at peace.",
